WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.567
Your customers don't stop calling at five.

00:00:03.417 --> 00:00:05.417
AI receptionist: Thanks for
calling NorthStar Plumbing.

00:00:05.457 --> 00:00:07.897
You've reached us after
hours. How can I help?

00:00:08.047 --> 00:00:10.701
Caller: My basement is flooding!
I need someone right now!

00:00:10.741 --> 00:00:12.621
AI receptionist:
I understand, this is urgent.

00:00:12.661 --> 00:00:15.411
I'm connecting you to the
on-call technician right now.

00:00:18.842 --> 00:00:21.522
Real emergencies reach your on-call line.

00:00:21.562 --> 00:00:24.462
Everything else is waiting in
the morning, with a summary.

00:00:25.402 --> 00:00:27.703
TradeCatch. Every call counts.

00:00:27.923 --> 00:00:30.234
Book your free audit at tradecatch.ca.

